WEBVTT

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:01.997
You are styling a pop-up window.

00:00:01.997 --> 00:00:04.572
Listen to a shopper ask for one blue
sweater.

00:00:04.982 --> 00:00:06.422
一件蓝色的毛衣。
One blue sweater.

00:00:07.352 --> 00:00:08.894
Listen to the end first.

00:00:08.894 --> 00:00:10.436
That part names the garment.

00:00:10.846 --> 00:00:11.608
毛衣。
Sweater.

00:00:12.018 --> 00:00:15.620
Sweater. If you hear this word, look for
sleeves and a knitted top.

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:17.729
蓝色的毛衣。
Blue sweater.

00:00:18.139 --> 00:00:20.537
Blue sweater. The color comes before the
garment.

00:00:20.537 --> 00:00:23.834
Here, the little word de joins the
description to the noun.

00:00:24.764 --> 00:00:25.780
一件毛衣。
One sweater.

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:29.583
One sweater. Listen for the measure word
between one and sweater.

00:00:29.993 --> 00:00:30.602
件。
Jiàn, a measure word.

00:00:31.012 --> 00:00:33.536
It works for many individual items of
clothing.

00:00:34.466 --> 00:00:37.897
Now keep the blue, but switch the sweater
to a pair of pants.

00:00:37.897 --> 00:00:38.952
Listen for two changes.

00:00:39.362 --> 00:00:40.894
一条蓝色的裤子。
One pair of blue pants.

00:00:41.824 --> 00:00:45.421
The garment changes to pants, and its
measure word changes too.

00:00:45.831 --> 00:00:47.271
一件蓝色的毛衣。
One blue sweater.

00:00:47.681 --> 00:00:49.212
一条蓝色的裤子。
One pair of blue pants.

00:00:49.622 --> 00:00:51.565
Which parts stayed the same? One and blue.

00:00:51.565 --> 00:00:54.721
You can swap one feature at a time to make
a new order.
